From 63aee5e957e825b273f662e38a0b06331c5c6ff7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Elvis Pranskevichus <el@prans.net>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:32:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Run packaged Codex daemon from shipped binary

The managed daemon can replace locally patched code with an upstream release, losing provider keyring and other port-specific behavior. Disable automatic updates by default and use the packaged CLI executable directly for daemon starts and restarts. Existing managed processes are replaced once their PID record shows a different path; legacy managed installations keep their original lifecycle.
